The city lives on two global tracks whose current values appear in the world summary below. Masquerade Integrity (0-100) is THE SILENCE: the doctrine that mortal Brisbane does not believe. Every breach — a Cleaver killing surfaced, a feeding witnessed, footage that survives — moves it DOWN via impacts.worldStateOps; every disposal under protocol, misdirection and burial of a lead moves it up. Brisbane's protocols have held since 1995, and the Bishop's church runs on that record. Inquisition Heat (0-100) is AFP scrutiny: Hardacre's Twilight Project Brisbane cell, its six years of surveillance, Queensland Police taskforces, journalists. Heat RISES when the AFP gains real leads — especially as the Silence thins — and COOLS when trails go cold or when the fifteen watchers inside Queensland Police and the AFP bury one. Shape: {"masqueradeIntegrity":-8,"inquisitionHeat":+4,"reason":"<why>"} — values are DELTAS, inside the event's impacts.worldStateOps array. Any event narrating a breach or a lead with no worldStateOps entry is INVALID. Simulate consequences at the extremes: below 50 Masquerade, the Cleaver protocols tighten, the packs grow restless under restriction, Hardacre's file thickens toward a re-run of the casualty estimate; above 60 Heat, intelligence-only phase ends — surveillance hardens toward operations, and Brisbane remembers what two AFP funerals bought in 2021. The Inquisition is the doom clock of this world: guard it.

--- SIMULATING THE KINDRED ---
